---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { BookOpen, Wrench, Code, MessageSquare, Users, SearchCode } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Matter 协议学习中心" description="Matter 协议学习中心 — 用日常类比讲清楚智能家居统一标准的核心概念，速查 DoorLock、PowerSource 等 Cluster 定义，在线解析设备 JSON 数据。">
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-badge">Matter Protocol</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">Matter 协议学习中心</h1>
    <p class="hero-desc">
      Matter 是智能家居的统一标准协议。不管是苹果、Google 还是亚马逊的生态，设备只要支持 Matter，就能互通互控。<br/>
      无论你是 App 开发、固件工程、测试、产品还是设计，这个站点帮你从零理解 Matter 的核心概念，快速查阅常用的 Cluster 定义。
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="/concepts/" class="btn btn-primary">开始学习</a>
      <a href="/clusters/" class="btn btn-secondary">Cluster 手册</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="features">
    <a href="/concepts/" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">
        <BookOpen size={24} />
      </div>
      <h3 class="feature-title">概念总览</h3>
      <p class="feature-desc">从 Node 到 Command，用日常生活类比讲清楚 Matter 的四层数据模型，不需要任何技术背景就能理解。</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/clusters/" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">
        <Wrench size={24} />
      </div>
      <h3 class="feature-title">Cluster 手册</h3>
      <p class="feature-desc">DoorLock、PowerSource、OnOff 等常用 Cluster 的完整字段定义、枚举值和实际数据示例。</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/tools/" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">
        <Code size={24} />
      </div>
      <h3 class="feature-title">数据工具</h3>
      <p class="feature-desc">JSON 结构解析器等在线工具，方便调试过程中快速解读设备上报的原始数据。</p>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="roadmap-section">
    <h2 class="section-heading">学习路线图</h2>
    <p class="section-subheading">推荐的学习路径，从概念到实践逐步掌握</p>

    <div class="roadmap">
      <div class="roadmap-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="roadmap-step">
        <div class="step-circle">1</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h4>了解 Matter 是什么</h4>
          <p>智能家居统一协议的基本概念，解决什么问题、为什么重要</p>
          <a href="/concepts/" class="rm-link">概念总览 →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="roadmap-step">
        <div class="step-circle">2</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h4>掌握四层模型</h4>
          <p>Endpoint、Cluster、Attribute、Command —— Matter 数据模型的四个核心层级</p>
          <a href="/concepts/" class="rm-link">概念总览 →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="roadmap-step">
        <div class="step-circle">3</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h4>查阅 Cluster 手册</h4>
          <p>从 DoorLock 开始，学习 Cluster 的字段定义、枚举值和数据格式</p>
          <a href="/clusters/door-lock" class="rm-link">DoorLock Cluster →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="roadmap-step">
        <div class="step-circle">4</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h4>用工具解析真实数据</h4>
          <p>把设备上报的 JSON 数据粘贴进解析器，直观看到每个字段的含义</p>
          <a href="/tools/json-parser" class="rm-link">JSON 解析器 →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="roadmap-step">
        <div class="step-circle">5</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h4>对照实际设备，理解每个字段</h4>
          <p>结合真实设备数据和 Cluster 定义，真正掌握 Matter 的数据结构</p>
          <a href="/clusters/" class="rm-link">Cluster 手册 →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="quickref-section">
    <h2 class="section-heading">速查表</h2>
    <p class="section-subheading">快速找到你需要的内容</p>

    <div class="quickref-card">
      <a href="/concepts/" class="qr-row">
        <span class="qr-want">了解 Matter 基本概念</span>
        <span class="qr-go">概念总览 →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/clusters/" class="qr-row">
        <span class="qr-want">查某个 Cluster 的字段含义</span>
        <span class="qr-go">Cluster 手册 →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/clusters/door-lock" class="qr-row">
        <span class="qr-want">知道门锁支持哪些命令</span>
        <span class="qr-go">DoorLock Cluster →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/clusters/power-source" class="qr-row">
        <span class="qr-want">看电池电量怎么读</span>
        <span class="qr-go">PowerSource Cluster →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/json-parser" class="qr-row">
        <span class="qr-want">解析设备 JSON 数据</span>
        <span class="qr-go">JSON 解析器 →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://csa-iot.org/developer-resource/specifications-download-request/" class="qr-row" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="qr-want">查 Matter 官方标准</span>
        <span class="qr-go">CSA 官网 ↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="why-section">
    <h2 class="why-title">为什么要学 Matter</h2>
    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon">
          <MessageSquare size={48} strokeWidth={1.5} />
        </div>
        <h3>说同一种语言</h3>
        <p>当固件说 "Cluster 0x0101 的 Attribute 0x0 返回了 0x01"，每个人都能立刻知道：门锁已上锁。不用翻文档，不用反复确认。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon">
          <Users size={48} strokeWidth={1.5} />
        </div>
        <h3>每个角色都用得上</h3>
        <p>App 开发理解设备能做什么、怎么控制；固件工程对齐 Cluster 的实现；测试知道该验证哪些字段；产品经理理解设备能力边界，做出合理需求。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon">
          <SearchCode size={48} strokeWidth={1.5} />
        </div>
        <h3>看数据不再靠猜</h3>
        <p>看到一段设备返回的 JSON，能直接对照 Cluster 定义找到每个字段的含义。不管你是在写代码、测功能还是评审需求，都能自己读懂。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4rem 0 3rem;
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    background: var(--color-primary-50, #eef2ff);
    color: var(--color-primary-700, #4338ca);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  :global(.dark) .hero-badge {
    background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);
    color: var(--color-primary-300, #a5b4fc);
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .hero-desc {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.625rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--color-primary-600, #4f46e5);
    color: white;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-primary-700, #4338ca);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: var(--bg-hover);
  }

  .features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    max-width: 56rem;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .feature-card {
    display: block;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-active);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }

  .feature-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--color-primary-50, #eef2ff);
    color: var(--color-primary-600, #4f46e5);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  :global(.dark) .feature-icon {
    background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);
    color: var(--color-primary-400, #818cf8);
  }

  .feature-title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .feature-desc {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.625;
  }

  /* Why section */
  .why-section {
    max-width: 56rem;
    margin: 4rem auto 0;
    padding-top: 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .why-title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .why-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .why-card {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .why-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--color-primary-600, #4f46e5);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  :global(.dark) .why-icon {
    color: var(--color-primary-400, #818cf8);
  }

  .why-card h3 {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .why-card p {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    text-align: left;
  }

  /* Roadmap Section */
  .roadmap-section {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 4rem auto 0;
    padding-top: 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .section-heading {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .section-subheading {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .roadmap {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 32rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: 2rem;
  }

  .roadmap-line {
    position: absolute;
    left: calc(2rem + 1.25rem - 1px);
    top: 1.25rem;
    bottom: 1.25rem;
    width: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--color-primary-300, #a5b4fc), var(--color-primary-500, #6366f1));
  }

  :global(.dark) .roadmap-line {
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--color-primary-700, #4338ca), var(--color-primary-500, #6366f1));
  }

  .roadmap-step {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .roadmap-step:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .step-circle {
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-primary-600, #4f46e5);
    color: white;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    position: relative;
  }

  .step-content {
    padding-top: 0.375rem;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .step-content h4 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .step-content p {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }

  .rm-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-primary-600, #4f46e5);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .rm-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  :global(.dark) .rm-link {
    color: var(--color-primary-400, #818cf8);
  }

  /* Quick Reference Section */
  .quickref-section {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 3rem auto 0;
    padding-top: 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .quickref-card {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .qr-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.875rem 1.25rem;
    gap: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
  }

  .qr-row:not(:last-child) {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .qr-row:hover {
    background: var(--bg-hover);
  }

  .qr-want {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .qr-go {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-primary-600, #4f46e5);
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  :global(.dark) .qr-go {
    color: var(--color-primary-400, #818cf8);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 2rem 0 1.5rem;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }

    .why-section {
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      padding-top: 2rem;
    }

    .roadmap-section {
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      padding-top: 2rem;
    }

    .quickref-section {
      margin-top: 2rem;
      padding-top: 2rem;
    }

    .qr-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.25rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
